ion of the operator $D$ to the function $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(y) & =D(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+x) \\\\  & =({x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x})(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+x) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+x)+x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+x) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{2}{x}+1)+x(\\frac{2}{x}+1) \\\\  & ={x}^{2}(-\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}})+x(\\frac{2}{x}+1) \\\\  & =-2+2+x \\\\  & =x\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036386/state.json" "file_sha256" "446c24c9b2761f4e6db752c185f73e628109b555dcbadb7ba3ec2d7f367dbb3a"} {"question" "q-91035" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036386/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6477498f472159f5747d570aac6faa791ca10b4dbb98a45ae4f566f3ce2a9d48"} {"question" "q-91035" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036386/state.json" "file_sha256" "446c24c9b2761f4e6db752c185f73e628109b555dcbadb7ba3ec2d7f367dbb3a"} {"question" "q-91035" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-2x"] ["math" "2-\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}}"] ["math" "4-x"] ["math" "x"] ["math" "x-4"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036386/state.json" "file_sha256" "446c24c9b2761f4e6db752c185f73e628109b555dcbadb7ba3ec2d7f367dbb3a"} {"question" "q-91035" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "x"] "category" "model_int