attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The given operator is a second-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={f}_{2}(x,y)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{f}_{1}(x,y)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{f}_{0}(x,y)y\n$$\n\nwith ${f}_{2}=y,{f}_{1}=-2xy,$ and ${f}_{0}=3y.$\n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y={x}^{2}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D({x}^{2}) & ={x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}({x}^{2})-2x({x}^{2})\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2})+3({x}^{2})^{2} \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x)-2x({x}^{2})\\cdot 2x+3{x}^{4} \\\\  & ={x}^{2}\\cdot 2-4{x}^{4}+3{x}^{4} \\\\  & =2{x}^{2}-{x}^{4} \\\\  & ={x}^{2}(2-{x}^{2})\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036386/state.json" "file_sha256" "446c24c9b2761f4e6db752c185f73e628109b555dcbadb7ba3ec2d7f367dbb3a"} {"question" "q-337846" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036386/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6477498f472159f5747d570aac6faa791ca10b4dbb98a45ae4f566f3ce2a9d48"} {"question" "q-337846" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036386/state.json" "file_sha256" "446c24c9b2761f4e6db752c185f73e628109b555dcbadb7ba3ec2d7f367dbb3a"} {"question" "q-337846" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{x}^{2}(1+{x}^{2})"] ["math" "{x}^{2}(1-{x}^{2})"] ["math" "{x}^{2}(2+{x}^{2})"] ["math" "{x}^{2}(2-2{x}^{2})"] ["math" "{x}^{2}(2-{x}^{2})"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacadem